WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.600
It’s project time! Build an interactive poster about a topic you care about: at least three sprites that react to clicks with facts, motion, sound or effects, linked by a broadcast, and reset on the green flag.

2
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:21.910
Make an interactive poster about a topic you care about — a sport, an animal, a place, a cause.

3
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.610
Each sprite reacts when clicked.

4
00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:32.690
For each sprite, decide its event (click or key) and its reaction (fact, sound, animation).

5
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:35.670
Draw a quick storyboard first.

6
00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:43.200
Use a broadcast so one click can start several reactions — like a title that makes everything dance.

7
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.470
Ask a classmate to explore your poster without help.

8
00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.240
Could they find every interaction?

9
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:53.950
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:57.460
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
